# W31d2, b (k10): in stag0201 with a; asks to go along with c only after c fell (epoch @900): its request waits without a
# stamp while nobody lives in c's stage group, and ends when c's game over closes the offer.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@800
log b sees the notice
idle until epoch>=@900
goalong until go=waiting or go=asked
log b asked to go along
idle until offers=0 fail go=stamped or stage=dng204b1
log the offer closed without a stamp
idle until frames>=300 fail stage=dng204b1
